      "caption": "Table S6a. Paired reference agreement.",
      "note": "Means are the transformed and standardized cluster-level marker-expression means defined in Section 2.4. Positive fractions are the per-marker proportions of cells with positive processed expression. Values are single-run outcomes averaged equally across the two B004 test regions. Paired changes subtract agreement using all-marker means from agreement using all-marker means plus fractions, in percentage points (pp). Missing or invalid predictions remain errors in the full planned denominator. All planned predictions were delivered; paired changes therefore reflect changes between valid labels.",
